            <creation xml:id="creation_305N20185">
               <date isodate="1862" xml:id="date_N20442">1862</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_305N20183">
               <p xml:id="idm220">The song was written for the silver wedding of the reverend Vilhelm Birkedal on 4 April 1862. During the Second Schleswig War in 1864 the melody became very polular with Grundtvig's poem "Hil dig, vor Fane". Hartmann was not aware of that until 1868.</p>
            </history>
